cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
type: dataset
title: "Artifact for A Session Is Not a Mandate: Safe Continuation for Agent Authorisation Across Policy Revisions"
abstract: >-
  Sanitised provider records, policy inputs, generated results and offline
  models for a study of whether cumulative limits on AI agents survive policy
  revisions in Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, Google Apigee and Anthropic Managed
  Agents. All checks run offline with the Python standard library. The live
  capture harnesses are included with their source commits and checksums.
